
  PythonOS 0.1 "Constrictor" — Alpine + OpenRC + Python.

  OpenRC manages the native system. Python provides the framework,
  shell, tools and userland above it.

    help       list commands          pyfetch    system information
    pytop      process monitor        pyedit     text editor
    pkg        package manager        py         run Python code

  Hosted desktop: install requirements.txt, then run pythonos-desktop.
  Try:  py "import this"      pkg search      starfield

